      {
        "letter": "c",
        "text": "2ʳ − r − 1"
      },
      {
        "letter": "d",
        "text": "2ʳ⁺¹ − r"
      }
    ],
    "answer": "c",
    "explanation": "n = 2ʳ − 1, so k = n − r = **2ʳ − r − 1** (r = 3 → 4).",
    "source": "PB Q131",
    "bookKeyCorrected": false
